WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:01.568
-Were there things of doing
a comedy with Seth Rogen,

00:00:01.568 --> 00:00:02.802 align:start size:94% position:6%
were there moments
where you were doing things

00:00:02.802 --> 00:00:03.903 align:start size:94% position:6%
that you couldn't believe
you were doing,

00:00:03.903 --> 00:00:06.239
based on all your previous work
up to that moment?

00:00:06.239 --> 00:00:10.043
I know it's not in the film,
but did you do some singing?

00:00:10.043 --> 00:00:10.844 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
-Okay.

00:00:10.844 --> 00:00:12.278 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I apologize.
Well, I don't.

00:00:12.278 --> 00:00:14.280
You're never gonna see it, so...
-Gotcha.

00:00:14.280 --> 00:00:16.816 align:start size:94% position:6%
Is that because
you underperformed?

00:00:16.816 --> 00:00:18.084 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
-Yeah, okay.

00:00:18.084 --> 00:00:20.153 align:start size:94% position:6%
-And by the way,
I acknowledged it.

00:00:20.153 --> 00:00:21.621 line:92%
I told them, I warned them.

00:00:21.621 --> 00:00:24.557 align:start size:94% position:6%
-You sang so bad,
it couldn't be in a comedy.

00:00:24.557 --> 00:00:28.094 align:start size:94% position:6%
-They wanted to --
[ Laughter ]

00:00:28.094 --> 00:00:29.796 align:start size:94% position:6%
It's true!
It's true!

00:00:29.796 --> 00:00:33.066 align:start size:94% position:6%
-[ Laughs ]
-They wanted to do this scene

00:00:33.066 --> 00:00:37.937
of me singing karaoke with
the Japanese Prime Minister.

00:00:37.937 --> 00:00:38.605 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Uh-huh.

00:00:38.605 --> 00:00:40.640 align:start size:94% position:6%
-And it was, like,
a Smash Mouth song.

00:00:40.640 --> 00:00:42.442 size:75% position:38%
-Right. Can I guess?
Was it "All Star"?

00:00:42.442 --> 00:00:44.310 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
-It was that Smash Mouth song?

00:00:44.310 --> 00:00:45.945 align:start size:94% position:6%
Yeah.
-And I couldn't sing that.

00:00:45.945 --> 00:00:48.248
-You couldn't sing "All Star"?
-I couldn't sing "All Star."

00:00:48.248 --> 00:00:49.716 align:start size:94% position:6%
I was --
I'm a terrible singer.

00:00:49.716 --> 00:00:51.684 align:start size:94% position:6%
And the thing is, is --
not even skill.

00:00:51.684 --> 00:00:55.188
I just -- it's the thing that
makes me the most anxious.

00:00:55.188 --> 00:00:56.723 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Uh-huh.
-I don't like it.

00:00:56.723 --> 00:00:57.157 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Sure.

00:00:57.157 --> 00:01:01.561
-Like, I would rather share,
like, state secrets than sing.

00:01:01.561 --> 00:01:06.299
-Yeah. Look, I'm no fan of it,
either, so I'm with you 100%.

00:01:06.299 --> 00:01:06.766 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Yeah.

00:01:06.766 --> 00:01:09.269 size:84% position:42%
-And I think karaoke
somehow makes it worse.

00:01:09.269 --> 00:01:11.538 size:84% position:42%
-Especially with people
who are really good.

00:01:11.538 --> 00:01:11.971 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Yeah.

00:01:11.971 --> 00:01:13.440 align:start size:94% position:6%
-They're just looking at you
like you're an idiot.

00:01:13.440 --> 00:01:14.307 line:92%
-Well, also, karaoke is like --

00:01:14.307 --> 00:01:17.143
It's kind of like training
wheels to actual singing.

00:01:17.143 --> 00:01:17.577 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Yeah.

00:01:17.577 --> 00:01:20.713
-So it's like being bad
on a bike with training wheels.

00:01:20.713 --> 00:01:21.681 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:21.681 --> 00:01:23.183 line:92%
It's like, "I crashed the bike."

00:01:23.183 --> 00:01:24.384 align:start size:94% position:6%
They're like,
"It had training wheels."

00:01:24.384 --> 00:01:26.586 align:start size:94% position:6%
I'm like, "I still crashed."
[ Laughter ]

00:01:26.586 --> 00:01:27.921 align:start size:94% position:6%
"I don't know what happened.
It was super bad."

00:01:27.921 --> 00:01:30.490 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I feel so [bleep]
about myself right now.

00:01:30.490 --> 00:01:32.459 align:start size:94% position:6%
-No, no.
I'm with you, I'm with you.

00:01:32.459 --> 00:01:35.161 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Wow. I get it.
No, I get it.

00:01:35.161 --> 00:01:37.130 align:start size:94% position:6%
I'm gonna remember that.
That's really --

00:01:37.130 --> 00:01:38.164 size:88% position:44% line:92%
A training wheels, yeah.

00:01:38.164 --> 00:01:39.966 align:start size:94% position:6%
-You --
We share something in common.

00:01:39.966 --> 00:01:43.703 align:start size:94% position:6%
We are both fans of Rihanna.
-Yes! Yes, yeah.

00:01:43.703 --> 00:01:45.505 align:start size:94% position:6%
-And you share
something else with her,

00:01:45.505 --> 00:01:47.874 align:start size:94% position:6%
which is you guys
have the same publicist.

00:01:47.874 --> 00:01:49.409 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Which is tough.
-Yeah.

00:01:49.409 --> 00:01:51.644 line:92%
-That's tough, because I get it.

00:01:51.644 --> 00:01:52.212 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
I mean, that's --

00:01:52.212 --> 00:01:53.980 align:start size:94% position:6%
Like, you want your publicist
to like you.

00:01:53.980 --> 00:01:56.549
Like you want to like think
that your publicist thinks

00:01:56.549 --> 00:01:59.185
