putting out there in the world.

00:01:59.185 --> 00:02:02.122 align:start size:94% position:6%
And that has to come
from a very authentic place.

00:02:02.122 --> 00:02:05.225
It's hard when your other client
is somebody like Rihanna.

00:02:05.225 --> 00:02:08.261 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
-Like, your coolest --

00:02:08.261 --> 00:02:09.496 size:81% position:41% line:92%
But I never thought --

00:02:09.496 --> 00:02:11.131 align:start size:94% position:6%
I always
really sincerely thought

00:02:11.131 --> 00:02:12.966 align:start size:94% position:6%
that my publicist
really loved me.

00:02:12.966 --> 00:02:14.567 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Sure.
-And then --

00:02:14.567 --> 00:02:16.803 line:92%
-I'm sure they do, by the way.

00:02:16.803 --> 00:02:17.337 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:17.337 --> 00:02:21.708
-So, for my birthday, she always
sends me, like, a little text.

00:02:21.708 --> 00:02:22.408 size:78% position:39% line:92%
And she just sends --

00:02:22.408 --> 00:02:24.511 align:start size:94% position:6%
Usually, it's just like,
