00:02:24.511 --> 00:02:25.812 align:start size:94% position:6%
Or, she didn't even
write "birthday."

00:02:25.812 --> 00:02:27.347 align:start size:94% position:6%
She just wrote "B-day."
-Uh-huh.

00:02:27.347 --> 00:02:31.651 align:start size:94% position:6%
-And then, I got --
Like, a couple of months ago,

00:02:31.651 --> 00:02:32.619 line:92%
