00:02:32.619 --> 00:02:34.521 align:start size:94% position:6%
I came home,
and it was a T-shirt.

00:02:34.521 --> 00:02:39.526
And she -- Rihanna had made a
T-shirt of the birthday greeting

00:02:39.526 --> 00:02:44.164
