which literally was like,

00:02:44.164 --> 00:02:48.301 align:start size:94% position:6%
"To my favorite,
most favorite client ever."

00:02:48.301 --> 00:02:49.536 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:49.536 --> 00:02:52.672 align:start size:94% position:6%
"Have the best --"
It was just, like, so...

00:02:52.672 --> 00:02:53.273 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:53.273 --> 00:02:55.241 align:start size:94% position:6%
And Rihanna wrote
in the following e-mail,

00:02:55.241 --> 00:02:58.077
