00:03:01.447 --> 00:03:02.682 size:81% position:41% line:92%
-And this is for real.

00:03:02.682 --> 00:03:04.050 size:81% position:41% line:92%
-But Amanda [bleep] --

00:03:04.050 --> 00:03:05.318 align:start size:94% position:6%
