-You brought it.

00:03:05.318 --> 00:03:06.319 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
-This is a real thing

00:03:06.319 --> 00:03:07.820 align:start size:94% position:6%
that Rihanna had made
to burn you.

00:03:07.820 --> 00:03:09.923 line:92%
-Rihanna made this for me, yeah.

00:03:09.923 --> 00:03:10.990 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:03:10.990 --> 00:03:14.194 align:start size:94% position:6%
"Oh, I hope
you're having a blast."

00:03:14.194 --> 00:03:16.262 align:start size:94% position:6%
-[ Laughs ]
Yeah.

00:03:16.262 --> 00:03:18.698
Yeah.
-That is -- That's really great.

00:03:18.698 --> 00:03:22.268 align:start size:94% position:6%
-No, I know. Right?
Made me feel great.

00:03:22.268 --> 00:03:24.504 align:start size:94% position:6%
-It's really funny.
[ Laughter ]

00:03:24.504 --> 00:03:25.305 line:92%
I mean, I guess, you know --

00:03:25.305 --> 00:03:26.873
I was like, "That's really nice
for Rihanna to do that,"

00:03:26.873 --> 00:03:29.042
but I guess
she's got T-shirt money, right?

00:03:29.042 --> 00:03:30.944 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:03:30.944 --> 00:03:32.612 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I think she has,
but she took the time

00:03:32.612 --> 00:03:34.314 size:78% position:39%
