-That's so nice of her.

00:03:35.782 --> 00:03:37.283 align:start size:94% position:6%
-That is really cool.
-Hey, thanks for being here.

00:03:37.283 --> 00:03:38.885 align:start size:94% position:6%
It's always such
a delight talking to you.

00:03:38.885 --> 00:03:40.954 line:92%
-Thank you for having me.

